After `./mvnw package`, run `java -jar target/foodrush.jar`, then call `/actuator/health`. It replies:

```json
{
  "groups": ["liveness", "readiness"],
  "status": "UP"
}
```

The important part is `"status": "UP"`, spaced out here for reading; the Actuator topic explains the groups.$sb131$)),
